.DS_Store
/tmp
/build
*.lock
*~

# Rust
/target
# Keep the workspace lockfile under version control even though *.lock is
# ignored above (that rule targets Ghidra project locks).
!Cargo.lock

# Ghidra project working files: volatile database + lock/journal files,
# regenerable from binary/STARS!.EXE. Not versioned.
/ghidra/*.gpr
/ghidra/*.gpr.lock
/ghidra/*.rep/
/ghidra/*.lock
/ghidra/*.lock~
